   "updated": 1,
   "link": null,
   "locked": false,
   "text": "one universal raw event stream\n(no per-game toggles):\n\nitem_shown (+expected time)\nfirst_touch · option_focus\noption_select / change · confirm\ntap_cancel · gut_swipe\npeek_reveal · bid_locked\nshelf_add · squeeze_remove\ncrowd_guess · bonus_played\ntext (typing ms, paste)\nvisibility · idle · nudge\nreward_shown · session_end",
   "originalText": "one universal raw event stream\n(no per-game toggles):\n\nitem_shown (+expected time)\nfirst_touch · option_focus\noption_select / change · confirm\ntap_cancel · gut_swipe\npeek_reveal · bid_locked\nshelf_add · squeeze_remove\ncrowd_guess · bonus_played\ntext (typing ms, paste)\nvisibility · idle · nudge\nreward_shown · session_end",
