   "text": "server-side, versioned:\n\nexpected-time model → residuals\nNOISE signals → quality 0–100,\n  bands, response weight 0–1\nENGAGEMENT score\nDIVERGENCE (insight, no penalty)\nper-person choice model + WTP\ncross-session clusters & trust\nrandomised experiment effects",
