   "text": "in-session: CUSUM → probe now,\n  pacing nudge, diagnostic follow-up\n\nafter: green = full weight,\n  amber = down-weight,\n  red (≥2 signals) = review\nnever auto-ban\nquality badge in brand reports\nAI explanation for reviewers",
   "originalText": "in-session: CUSUM → probe now,\n  pacing nudge, diagnostic follow-up\n\nafter: green = full weight,\n  amber = down-weight,\n  red (≥2 signals) = review\nnever auto-ban\nquality badge in brand reports\nAI explanation for reviewers",
